and took her into his arms, until she recovered: and he comforted her with peaceable words, and said to her, What is the matter, Esther? I am thy brother; be of good cheer, thou shalt not die, for our command is openly declared to thee, Draw nigh.	Esther 5	urn:cts:copticLit:ot.esth.coptot:5	1	sahidic
